# fixture-git-env-seam's starts of scripts/validate-fixture-git-env.sh (BL-879 grammar). Every arm-W pass is in
# process: vf_ip sources the validator in a subshell paired with fx_inproc and calls vfge_main against the probe root. One cli
# cell per distinct CLI outcome (exit 1 over the ceiling, exit 0 under it), each started as FXCELL=<id> bash on the
# probe's copy in vf_cli and compared byte for byte with vf_ip on the same arguments.
cli scripts/validate-fixture-git-env.sh cli-refuse
cli scripts/validate-fixture-git-env.sh cli-pass
# The inner fixtures run from the root: their own cells credit the validate-audit-anchors.sh and unregistered-drift.sh
# starts (inputs.decl holds both cells.decl files for the sandbox).
drives trunk-push-bound
drives setup-config-drift
